# 默认按文本处理，并在检出时统一成 LF：本仓库所有文件都是 LF，
# 固定 eol 可以避免 Windows 上 core.autocrlf 造成的伪改动与换行告警。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 脚本与文档
*.ps1   text eol=lf
*.psm1  text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf

# 二进制：禁止行尾转换与文本 diff
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.zip   binary
*.gz    binary
*.7z    binary
*.exe   binary
*.dll   binary
*.pdf   binary
